     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div>I read tree-data book and found that there is a fantastic combination of phylogenetic tree and other data. I wonder whether there is a parameter that can control the ratio between left and right panel. Presently, it is in equally split.</div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:16px;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:auto;break-inside:avoid;direction:ltr;border-width:initial;border-style:none;color:rgb(51,51,51);padding:0.85em 1em;background:rgb(247,247,247);letter-spacing:0.2px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:0.85em;overflow:initial;white-space:pre;break-inside:avoid;direction:ltr;border-width:initial;border-style:none;color:inherit;background:0px 0px;display:inline;max-width:initial;line-height:inherit\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">library</span>(ggridges)</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html#cb215-2\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html%23cb215-2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482207960000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0hXIQ_PKSv1ErlwBo58IFH\"></a></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html#cb215-3\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html%23cb215-3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482207960000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1sD6P8IQAxGIJMF16mzKjB\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">data</span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">&quot;GlobalPatterns&quot;</span>)</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html#cb215-4\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html%23cb215-4&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482207960000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CVew0EAfwGPWGu0XFRo4K\"></a>GP &lt;-<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\"> </span>GlobalPatterns</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html#cb215-5\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html%23cb215-5&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482207960000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Vmk6Xn9dbfASI4AdilNS9\"></a>GP &lt;-<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">prune_taxa</span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">taxa_sums</span>(GP) <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,160,112)\">600</span>, GP)</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html#cb215-6\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html%23cb215-6&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482207960000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0aA2wZmwvS2f73jui_ZLCh\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">sample_data</span>(GP)<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">$</span>human &lt;-<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">get_variable</span>(GP, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">&quot;SampleType&quot;</span>) <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">%in%</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\"> </span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html#cb215-7\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html%23cb215-7&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482207960000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1PPTYzZAugsR3CffCD0AIp\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">  </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">c</span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">&quot;Feces&quot;</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">&quot;Skin&quot;</span>) </span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inl