\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(144,32,0)\">rngseed=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,160,112)\">394582</span>)</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html#cb215-11\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html%23cb215-11&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482207960000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1p75bF_wLZIAKcfIVg3ALO\"></a>mergedGP &lt;-<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">tax_glom</span>(mergedGP,<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">&quot;Order&quot;</span>) </span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html#cb215-12\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html%23cb215-12&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482207960000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2IVEgdalRY2L4DsyibCJ1O\"></a></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html#cb215-13\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html%23cb215-13&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482207960000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1gyKag0yWDBoVeCnD4p-iU\"></a>melt_simpl