;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">select</span>(OTU, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(144,32,0)\">val=</span>Abundance)</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html#cb215-16\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html%23cb215-16&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482207960000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Xtsg6JL45MaUkcfqibzlP\"></a></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html#cb215-17\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html%23cb215-17&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482207960000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0LxgmeenAU7-9SgpkWRXz5\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">ggtree</span>(mergedGP) <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(102,102,102)\">+</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\"> </span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html#cb215-18\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html%23cb215-18&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482207961000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1gbJ0-JtUNIrJiUqVTN7lr\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;col