     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div>I read tree-data book and found that there is a fantastic combination of phylogenetic tree and other data. I wonder whether there is a parameter that can control the ratio between left and right panel. Presently, it is in equally split.</div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:16px;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow:auto;break-inside:avoid;direction:ltr;border-width:initial;border-style:none;color:rgb(51,51,51);padding:0.85em 1em;background:rgb(247,247,247) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;letter-spacing:0.2px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:0.85em;overflow:initial;white-space:pre-wrap;break-inside:avoid;direction:ltr;border-width:initial;border-style:none;color:inherit;background:rgba(0,0,0,0) none repeat scroll 0px 0px;display:inline;max-width:initial;line-height:inherit\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">library</span>(ggridges)</span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit\"><a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html#cb215-2\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:rgba(0,0,0,0) none repeat scroll 0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter10.html%23cb215-2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482207974000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2UTOQ1Rp7mjrABfLIhyTGY\"></a></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25;color:inhe